   "originalText": "ONE serializer of ALL committed view surfaces: .excalidraw, .svg,\nand now progress.html. render and stale both write through it;\nthe byte-compare set becomes a TRIO. FIX_LINE grows to add the\nthird file; F12's spelled literal updated with it.",
